        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVNEW19, Newport Rope Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Newport Leverset is classy in its appearance, a traditional door lever that is sure to be eye catching on any door. The Fifth Avenue Plate is 11 inches x 2-5/8 inches--big enough to stand out on even oversized doors. This Newport Rope Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in dummy, passage or privacy functions in a beautiful selection of finishes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/newport-keyed-entry-lever-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favnew19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Rope Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rope Leverset with Extra Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVTP-specifications.pdf?v=1704262363\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rope Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate",
                "description": "Grandeur's Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Newport Leverset is classy in its appearance, a traditional door lever that is sure to be eye catching on any door. The Fifth Avenue Plate is 11 inches x 2-5/8 inches--big enough to stand out on even oversized doors. This Newport Rope Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in dummy, passage or privacy functions in a beautiful selection of finishes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. ",
